{"schema_version":2,"unit_id":"tag:05Y0:prose-0001","parent_tag":"05Y0","chapter":"criteria","node_kind":"paragraph","risk_level":"R3","source_commit":"a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14","source_text":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nWe continue the discussion started in\nMore on Morphisms, Section <REF_0001>.\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a scheme. Let <MATH_0002> and <MATH_0003> be morphisms of\nalgebraic spaces over <MATH_0004>. Given a scheme <MATH_0005> we can consider pairs\n<MATH_0006> where <MATH_0007>\nis a morphism and <MATH_0008>\nis a morphism over <MATH_0009>. Picture\n<MATH_0010>\nOf course, we can also think of <MATH_0011> as a morphism\n<MATH_0012> such that\n<MATH_0013>\ncommutes. In this situation we can define a functor\n<MATHSEG_0001> as above<MATHSEG_0002>\nSometimes we think of this as a functor defined on the category\nof schemes over <MATH_0014>, in which case we drop <MATH_0015> from the notation.\n\n","source_status":"CURRENT","placeholders":{"STRUCT_0001":"\\noindent","REF_0001":"\\ref{more-morphisms-section-relative-morphisms}","STRUCT_0002":"\\medskip","STRUCT_0003":"\\noindent","MATH_0001":"$S$","MATH_0002":"$Z \\to B$","MATH_0003":"$X \\to B$","MATH_0004":"$S$","MATH_0005":"$T$","MATH_0006":"$(a, b)$","MATH_0007":"$a : T \\to B$","MATH_0008":"$b : T \\times_{a, B} Z \\to T \\times_{a, B} X$","MATH_0009":"$T$","MATH_0010":"\\begin{equation}\n\\label{equation-hom}\n\\vcenter{\n\\xymatrix{\nT \\times_{a, B} Z \\ar[rd] \\ar[rr]_b & &\nT \\times_{a, B} X \\ar[ld] & Z \\ar[rd] & & X \\ar[ld] \\\\\n& T \\ar[rrr]^a & & & B\n}\n}\n\\end{equation}","MATH_0011":"$b$","MATH_0012":"$b : T \\times_{a, B} Z \\to X$","MATH_0013":"$$\n\\xymatrix{\nT \\times_{a, B} Z \\ar[r] \\ar[d] \\ar@/^1pc/[rrr]_-b &\nZ \\ar[rd] & & X \\ar[ld] \\\\\nT \\ar[rr]^a & & B\n}\n$$","MATHSEG_0001":"\\begin{equation}\n\\label{equation-hom-functor}\n\\mathit{Mor}_B(Z, X) : (\\Sch/S)^{opp} \\longrightarrow \\textit{Sets},\n\\quad\nT \\longmapsto \\{(a, b)\\text{","MATHSEG_0002":"}\\}\n\\end{equation}","MATH_0014":"$B$","MATH_0015":"$a$"},"render":{"prefix":"","suffix":""},"math_text_regions":[{"region_id":"math/0001","delimiter_kind":"environment","source":"\\begin{equation}\n\\label{equation-hom-functor}\n\\mathit{Mor}_B(Z, X) : (\\Sch/S)^{opp} \\longrightarrow \\textit{Sets},\n\\quad\nT \\longmapsto \\{(a, b)\\text{ as above}\\}\n\\end{equation}","source_hash":"sha256:57b70b1137ca055f3ab939a96f4e42c3e8e16e79e45c1fa068dae78768f35a3c","source_byte_span":{"start":858,"end":1034},"pieces":[{"kind":"locked","placeholder":"MATHSEG_0001"},{"kind":"text","slot_id":"math/0001/text/0001"},{"kind":"locked","placeholder":"MATHSEG_0002"}],"slots":[{"slot_id":"math/0001/text/0001","source":" as above","command":"text","policy_entry":"deformations-natural-2","slot_byte_span":{"start":149,"end":158},"boundary_placeholders":["MATHSEG_0001","MATHSEG_0002"],"classification_witness":{"usage":"deformations-source-frames","usage_source":{"before":")","after":"\\}","environments":["equation"]},"source_label":"criteria-section-relative-morphisms","policy_hash":"sha256:f8a34b4e5b7d68795e0dc64557b5b4e7dbafccbf0b101ba18991531598581f9b","anchor":{"source_commit":"a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14","file":"criteria.tex","owner_tag":"05Y0","owner_label":"criteria-section-relative-morphisms","kind":"section","ordinal":1,"matches":[{"container_byte_span":{"start":50351,"end":50527},"container_hash":"sha256:57b70b1137ca055f3ab939a96f4e42c3e8e16e79e45c1fa068dae78768f35a3c","command_byte_span":{"start":50494,"end":50510},"command_hash":"sha256:ed3a2605aa3ec7c72d20a2c1cdff2241f2b7a15c55742023bbd0b51966c661aa"}]}}}]}],"source_math_skeleton_hash":"sha256:7611cfa338d92b25f01c0861e2cf7559fda39f80bfdb4a6bc162fd9e29150c0f","source_text_hash":"sha256:6412a9f36c37bc36431f97da0a6f9797950ee99318639af3c17d01658bb81421","source_structure_hash":"sha256:027468b7282ec3177f61b924c3651807b6da7b29a7d4b741634161f8b1752406","source_math_hash":"sha256:39c573ee59e7bbf653