{"schema_version":2,"unit_id":"tag:05Y3:statement","parent_tag":"05Y0","chapter":"criteria","node_kind":"lemma","risk_level":"R3","source_commit":"a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14","source_text":"Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme. Let <MATH_0002> and <MATH_0003> be morphisms of\nalgebraic spaces over <MATH_0004>. Then\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0005> is a sheaf on\n<MATH_0006>.\n<STRUCT_0003> If <MATH_0007> is an algebraic space over <MATH_0008>, then there is a\ncanonical bijection\n<MATHSEG_0001> as in <MATHSEG_0002>\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","source_status":"CURRENT","placeholders":{"MATH_0001":"$S$","MATH_0002":"$Z \\to B$","MATH_0003":"$X \\to B$","MATH_0004":"$S$","STRUCT_0001":"\\begin{enumerate}","STRUCT_0002":"\\item","MATH_0005":"$\\mathit{Mor}_B(Z, X)$","MATH_0006":"$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$","STRUCT_0003":"\\item","MATH_0007":"$T$","MATH_0008":"$S$","MATHSEG_0001":"$$\n\\Mor_{\\Sh((\\Sch/S)_{fppf})}(T, \\mathit{Mor}_B(Z, X))\n=\n\\{(a, b)\\text{","MATHSEG_0002":"}(\\ref{equation-hom})\\}\n$$","STRUCT_0004":"\\end{enumerate}"},"render":{"prefix":"\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-hom-functor-sheaf}\n","suffix":"\\end{lemma}"},"math_text_regions":[{"region_id":"math/0001","delimiter_kind":"display-dollar","source":"$$\n\\Mor_{\\Sh((\\Sch/S)_{fppf})}(T, \\mathit{Mor}_B(Z, X))\n=\n\\{(a, b)\\text{ as in }(\\ref{equation-hom})\\}\n$$","source_hash":"sha256:5cb3e9135474b4e5efcf9d57ee493a66b32a87fc70b205c60b253aade2fd0923","source_byte_span":{"start":304,"end":409},"pieces":[{"kind":"locked","placeholder":"MATHSEG_0001"},{"kind":"text","slot_id":"math/0001/text/0001"},{"kind":"locked","placeholder":"MATHSEG_0002"}],"slots":[{"slot_id":"math/0001/text/0001","source":" as in ","command":"text","policy_entry":"deformations-natural-3","slot_byte_span":{"start":72,"end":79},"boundary_placeholders":["MATHSEG_0001","MATHSEG_0002"],"classification_witness":{"usage":"deformations-source-frames","usage_source":{"before":")","after":"(","environments":[]},"source_label":"criteria